          "postedAt": "2019-12-01T09:29:50.615Z",
          "renderedText": "Carlos85\n — \n12/1/19, 1:29 AM\nSunday, December 1, 2019 at 1:29 AM\nOk guys, I will post this here now because the question „which item is best“ is coming most all days. At minute 46:16 I start to compare 3 cars on Koopa Beach. Level 6 common, Level 5 super and Level 4 high end. It took 3 races too see what is the best. This system works everytime! I don’t have the time today to make a extra video from the stream yesterday, so please don’t see this as self advertise, it’s a help how to compare irrend! \nSo, go to Minute 46:16 when Koopa Beach Starts https://youtu.be/UxK_l5hYntM\nYouTube\nCarlos85\nLIVE Mario Kart Winter Tour - #1 All Cups! 5 hours Highscore push!",
          "text": "Ok guys, I will post this here now because the question „which item is best“ is coming most all days. At minute 46:16 I start to compare 3 cars on Koopa Beach. Level 6 common, Level 5 super and Level 4 high end. It took 3 races too see what is the best. This system works everytime! I don’t have the time today to make a extra video from the stream yesterday, so please don’t see this as self advertise, it’s a help how to compare irrend! \nSo, go to Minute 46:16 when Koopa Beach Starts https://youtu.be/UxK_l5hYntM"
